WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.700
It's the first warning!

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.500
Watch in a well-lit place,
and don't sit too close, okay?

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.350
At last, we have found him.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.000
It has indeed been a long journey.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.720
We should be arriving there within minutes.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.630
Very soon now.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.790
You will meet him soon, Rizel.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:15.120
Suddenly! Child Bride!?

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:29.820
DAMN, DAMN, DAMN, DAMN, DAMN, DAMN!!

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.730
SHIT!!!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:41.650
Don't block my way!

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.630
Hi!

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:49.690
Good morning, class!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:53.040
Time for another fun day of studying together!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.210
Oh! Sensei, what's that ring?

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:01.760
Ah, the secret's out!

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.550
When's the ceremony?

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.180
What kind of person is your husband?

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:10.690
Oh, goodness!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:16.270
What are you gonna do, Iwaki-kun?
Sensei says she's getting married!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:19.360
S-S-So what? Like it has anything to do with me!

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:23.700
To hell with that! To hell with marriage!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.990
Shit!!!

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.600
Damn it! This sucks ass!

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.150
I never learn, do I?

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:57.400
I've had my heart broken by another older woman.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.230
Damn it, why do I always...?

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.570
Welcome home, Darling!

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.080
I finally get to meet you!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.790
I've been waiting for this day for a long~ time!

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:14.700
Huh?

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.490
Darling? Darling!

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.920
I'm... I'm gonna die...

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.930
Oh my! Not out here!

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:26.400
Eh?! W-W-Who the hell are you?!
Oh my! Not out here!

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.540
Eh?! W-W-Who the hell are you?!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.890
Ah! No good, no good.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:35.770
Please forgive my delay in saying so,

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:39.270
but I have formally become your wife as of today.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:40.860
My name is Rizel.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.690
Ah! I said, "wife"!

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.160
What are you, stupid?

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.560
No!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.180
I've got the marriage form right here!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.960
Hey!! I'm fifteen years old and what is this?

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.420
Power of the State!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.010
That's how it's referred to.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.100
W-Who are you old guys?!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.260
And what're you doing in there?!

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:07.800
We are not "old guys!"

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.300
We are...

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.410
Rizel's...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.810
Papas!

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:13.670
P-Papas?!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:15.550
PAPAS!

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.810
That's what they say, anyway.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.900
Dad! Mom!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:22.350
If only they were young, beautiful Mamas...

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.230
That's not the issue here!

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:27.190
Don't be upset, Darling!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.770
Today is our wedding anniversary.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.620
Don't joke around!

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:40.830
What are you doing?!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.980
Rizel is composed of cells containing special DNA,

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.760
engineered by our nation's top scientists!

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.370
She is a Proto-Mankind!

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.500
Enough with the nonsense babble!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.850
This is my first time being yelled at, thrown,
and hit by my husband!

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.240
Why you...

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.060
And now I'm being swung around for the first time!
Why you...

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.770
And now I'm being swung around for the first time!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.880
Allow us to explain everything.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.510
It's top secret, so we can't
say anything else right now.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.390
What's with that?!

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:42.480
Anyway, it was decided at the national level
that Rizel would be your wife.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.170
You mustn't make her upset!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.840
No matter what...

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.480
Quit making decisions for me!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:48.590
That's right!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:52.780
It's already hard enough feeding
one child on my husband's low income!

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:56.080
Y-Yeah, I don't even have my own private study room!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:59.330
And the loan on this house still has
more than thirty years left on it!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:02.040
If we were to add another
family member at this point...

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.540
His spending allowance is zero! Zero!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.250
Promotion to department manager...

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:12.010
Water, gas, and medical expenses fully exempt.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:16.180
Debt on the home loan cleared in its entirety...

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.770
Happousai: A Chinese dish with pork,
shrimp, vegetables, etc.
Are you fine with happousai for dinner?

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:20.220
Oh, don't trouble yourself over us, ma'am.
Happousai: A Chinese dish with pork,
shrimp, vegetables, etc.
Are you fine with happousai for dinner?

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.060
Happousai: A Chinese dish with pork,
shrimp, vegetables, etc.
Oh, don't trouble yourself over us, ma'am.

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.520
I think the baseball game's starting.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.360
Hey, don't get friendly with them all of the sudden!!

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:29.320
Even if my parents accept this, I won't!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.590
Um...

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:31.440
What?!

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.030
Um... on the first night after our wedding,

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:37.440
I get to be carried to bed
like a princess, right?

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.280
Carry me like...

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.660
...a princess!

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:46.960
Oh, Darling!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:50.840
Oh my, you're so impatient!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.930
I'm into older women!

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.100
So, I don't feel anything for you!

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:03.960
Geez...

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:06.230
So I just need to become older than you?

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.060
Yeah, become older than me.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.190
Okay! I'll try my best!

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:14.030
Idiot! That's not possible!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.910
If you're younger, then you'll always be younger.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.330
And if you're older, you'll always be older!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.490
And anyway, look at you!
You look like a grade-schooler!

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.540
It's out of the question!

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:27.440
It won't work, no matter what?

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.500
Nope!

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.210
No matter what?

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.600
Give it up!

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:33.550
I might cry...

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.270
You think that'll work on me?

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.130
You mustn't make her cry!

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.800
Rizel! Don't cry!

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.220
Be a good girl and hold it in!

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:44.350
Hang in there, hold it back, Rizel!

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:45.680
Don't cry! Don't cry!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.180
Rizel!

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:50.230
It's no use! Take cover!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.470
Take cover? From what?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.900
Why?

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:55.530
Huh?

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:57.530
Why...?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.460
Why is it out of the question?!

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:12.110
Darling, you dummy!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:12.710
Hey! Hurry up and stop her!
Darling, you dummy!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:13.930
Hey! Hurry up and stop her!

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:15.170
The house'll be destroyed!!

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:17.380
W-W-What is this?!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:20.810
Rizel's tears are almost
chemically identical to nitroglycerin!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.220
When she gets like this,
even we can't stop her!

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:30.820
Don't cry, Rizel! You can
live here for now, okay?!

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:37.860
Really?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.240
Yeah.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.110
Really and truly?

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:42.780
It's not like I have a choice!!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.830
I love you, Darling!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.620
But I didn't say you could cling to me!

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:56.500
I was tossed into the setting sun
by my husband for the first time!

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:56.710
Hinomaru Construction

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.470
This level of damage should be easily fixable.
Hinomaru Construction

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:02.590
Even if it were blown up completely,
it'd only take 2-3 days...
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:05.180
It's times like this when
secret funding comes in handy.
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.020
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.850
Here, have some happousai before it gets cold!
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.060
Sorry about all the trouble. How about another beer?
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:13.020
Aww, thanks!
Sorry about all the trouble. How about another beer?
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:13.360
Hinomaru Construction

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.870
I'm so excited about our first night of marriage!

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:29.080
No~! I said, "first night"!

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.670
Wait for me, Darling!

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:39.050
This has been the worst day ever.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.120
Darling!

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.540
W-What is it?!
C-Couldn't you at least knock?!

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.050
Although I am not worthy,
please look kindly upon me.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.840
What's with those clothes?

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.760
Aww, c'mon!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:24.740
A newlywed only wears a kimono liner to bed, right?

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:25.510
Huh?

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:26.850
Here I come!

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.850
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey hey!

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:32.810
Ooh, you're so <i>aggressive</i>, Darling!

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.440
What are you doing?!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.610
I looked it up in the library,

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:39.400
and apparently, newlyweds do good things
while sharing a futon!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:42.690
What kind of book was that?!
If you're going to sleep, go to another room!

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:43.990
But!

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:46.030
D-D-Don't cry!!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.330
Then can I sleep in this room?

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.290
I guess I'm all out of options...

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.580
Then let's get to it!

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.000
Not there!!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.040
You sleep in there.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.380
Darling?

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:07.510
I'm glad that you're so nice to me.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.460
Yeah, right.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:10.850
How am I being nice?

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.430
You said you didn't like it, but you still let me sleep in the same room!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.280
It's cause you're a pain when you start crying!

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.860
Idiot!

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.910
Aah! No! Wait! Stop!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.540
Don't cry! Don't cry!! DON'T CRY!!!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.360
Dum-da-da-dum! It's Rizel!

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:15.180
The thing I love is... umm... my husband!

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:18.300
What's important to me... umm... Darling!

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.420
Fight, Rizel! You're great, Rizel!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.820
I'll go "hahuhuhu hafuun~!"

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.320
Dum-da-da-dum! It's Rizel!

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.120
The thing I love is... umm... my husband!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:35.220
What's important to me... umm... Darling!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.720
I lo-lo-looove my husband!

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:40.190
But he's always angry.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:44.030
I wonder if he's just tired?
Every day can be fun if you smile!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:47.170
Okay, Darling, it's time for Project Smile!

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.170
Let's do our best!

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.250
Fight, Rizel! You're great, Rizel!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.740
I'll go "hahuhuhu hafuun~!"
